@startuml
!theme amiga

top to bottom direction
hide empty members

class pkg_a.core <<(M, #2ECC71)>>
class pkg_a.services <<(M, #2ECC71)>>
class pkg_b.util <<(M, #2ECC71)>>

pkg_a.core <-[#C0392B,bold]-> pkg_b.util : edge_weight=1/1
note on link
  **pkg_a.core -> pkg_b.util:**
